    <briefdescription>
<para>Frozen logical data are logical data which can be accessed outside tasks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>They are created using ctx.freeze, which returns a <ref refid="classcuda_1_1experimental_1_1stf_1_1frozen__logical__data" kindref="compound">frozen_logical_data</ref> object. The get() and unfreeze() method allow to get an instance of the frozen data that is valid until unfreeze is called. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
